# Web UI

- UI product work waits on Phase 1 design artifacts (`@docs/MASTER_PLAN.md` / `@docs/phases/PHASE_1.md`). `/design` sandbox is not current Phase 1 law.
- Theme follows Phase 1 visual system once published. Do not invent dark-mode themes or toggles before then.
- Muse UX (when in scope): ghost suggestion, Tab accept, other key dismiss.
- Existing TipTap / chrome in the tree is working reference until Phase 1 review.
